    "summary": "FLIMKit lifetime fitting and phasor maps as napari layers",
    "description": "# flimkit-napari\n\nA napari dock widget for FLIMKit. It fits a FLIM file per pixel and adds intensity, tau, fraction and chi2 maps as layers, or adds phasor G and S maps.\nIt imports flimkit and flimkit-bridge directly, so no server runs.\n\n    pip install -e .\n\nOpen napari, then Plugins > FLIMKit.\n",
